{"3579980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Departure of Darkness", "steam_appid": 3579980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/7cd54a1815fd08e454226c99303f044e.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1247 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s 2005 and you’re going to the airport to pick up your brother, Jake. Chaos ensues as the airport becomes infested with parasitic creatures. You’ll need to unlock passages, find secrets, scavenge for supplies, and get to the runway to save your brother all while fighting or avoiding the parasites! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/2a294413e78a9e504ee46767cf5a11f0.poster.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/2a294413e78a9e504ee46767cf5a11f0.webm?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/2a294413e78a9e504ee46767cf5a11f0.mp4?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/525c0b7d0ffa7375d1d38264f389e17a.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1247 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tread carefully and avoid stepping on the veins, or else the eggs will hatch deadly parasites. If you don’t deal with them in time, they will take over the dead bodies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/24d206c5f310a6ce97e7b752227ad7db.poster.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/24d206c5f310a6ce97e7b752227ad7db.webm?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/24d206c5f310a6ce97e7b752227ad7db.mp4?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/05ce6868044e13f56c412fa270c65fdb.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1247 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to complete optional puzzles for extra supplies, additional guns, and secret shortcuts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/14d8dc72bff14378e12b3f220d9d018c.poster.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/14d8dc72bff14378e12b3f220d9d018c.webm?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/14d8dc72bff14378e12b3f220d9d018c.mp4?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/fa3e21612a627c006c1c8e1e734bf90b.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1247 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventure, you will meet a variety of survivors and communicate with them via flip-phone. You will have the choice to clear the path and lead them to safety…or leave them behind! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned: your choices matter! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/f623640a19a17022290123eb72e6061d.poster.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/f623640a19a17022290123eb72e6061d.webm?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/f623640a19a17022290123eb72e6061d.mp4?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/291e2a7eeb4860e9e8d23e8c14e1062b.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1247 height=100 /></span>Customizable options for both new and seasoned players! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable game difficulty </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and hard modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Option for highlightable interactables </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional indication for game-changing choices </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Option to save anywhere (enable in menu) </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtitles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice of Classic Tank Controls or Modern Controls </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple aiming systems with optional support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable key binding </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/25f422cc627109425f728bba221e728f.poster.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/25f422cc627109425f728bba221e728f.webm?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/25f422cc627109425f728bba221e728f.mp4?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/7cd54a1815fd08e454226c99303f044e.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1247 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s 2005 and you’re going to the airport to pick up your brother, Jake. Chaos ensues as the airport becomes infested with parasitic creatures. You’ll need to unlock passages, find secrets, scavenge for supplies, and get to the runway to save your brother all while fighting or avoiding the parasites! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/2a294413e78a9e504ee46767cf5a11f0.poster.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/2a294413e78a9e504ee46767cf5a11f0.webm?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/2a294413e78a9e504ee46767cf5a11f0.mp4?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/525c0b7d0ffa7375d1d38264f389e17a.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1247 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tread carefully and avoid stepping on the veins, or else the eggs will hatch deadly parasites. If you don’t deal with them in time, they will take over the dead bodies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/24d206c5f310a6ce97e7b752227ad7db.poster.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/24d206c5f310a6ce97e7b752227ad7db.webm?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/24d206c5f310a6ce97e7b752227ad7db.mp4?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/05ce6868044e13f56c412fa270c65fdb.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1247 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to complete optional puzzles for extra supplies, additional guns, and secret shortcuts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/14d8dc72bff14378e12b3f220d9d018c.poster.avif?t=1788254398\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/14d8dc72bff14378e12b3f220d9d018c.webm?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/14d8dc72bff14378e12b3f220d9d018c.mp4?t=1788254398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p clas